1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,380
This is a zebra crossing.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:04,541
White stripes mark it on the road.

3
00:00:04,541 --> 00:00:06,715
A person steps onto the crossing.

4
00:00:06,715 --> 00:00:10,093
In the United Kingdom, a driver must then give way.

5
00:00:10,093 --> 00:00:15,647
The car stops, and the person walks across.

6
00:00:15,647 --> 00:00:18,093
The car goes on when the road is clear.

7
00:00:18,093 --> 00:00:23,917
The first zebra crossing opened in Slough on 31 October 1951.
